From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MCOS <support@muthur-command.com>
Subject: [PATCH] neardi/lb200: skip DM ns16550_init when UART owned by SPL

Vendor SPL/ATF already owns the debug UART; CONFIG_DEBUG_UART_SKIP_INIT
only covered the debug_uart helpers, not the DM serial probe path.
---
--- a/drivers/serial/ns16550.c
+++ b/drivers/serial/ns16550.c
@@ -241,6 +241,9 @@ void ns16550_init(struct ns16550 *com_port, int baud_divisor)
 	}
 #endif
 
+	if (IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_DEBUG_UART_SKIP_INIT))
+		return;
+
 	while (!(serial_in(&com_port->lsr) & UART_LSR_TEMT))
 		;
 
